From: coolsnowwolf <coolsnowwolf@gmail.com>
Subject: [PATCH] airoha-xpon: support the Linux 5.4 BSP

Preserve the complete local 5.4 adaptation against upstream e5194d2,
including the frontend compatibility fixes present in the working tree.

Signed-off-by: coolsnowwolf <coolsnowwolf@gmail.com>
